{"id":"662216","name":"油焖大虾","author":"卡布奇诺的浪漫8","authorId":"10188287","desc":"","cover":"images/662216/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"10只"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1根"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备大虾。","img":"images/662216/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剪去虾腔，虾脚，虾尾，虾开背去虾线。","img":"images/662216/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备葱段，葱花，香菜段，姜片。","img":"images/662216/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油下入虾。","img":"images/662216/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"一面煎至变色后翻另一面继续煎。","img":"images/662216/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下入葱段，姜片。","img":"images/662216/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入胡椒粉，白糖，盐，松鲜鲜，倒入蚝油，料酒和少许水。","img":"images/662216/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"收汁后加入葱花和香菜段。","img":"images/662216/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油焖大虾制作完成。","img":"images/662216/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}